{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.906886+00:00", "case_id": "C001", "input_text": "La senora llego sin pulso, no respira y no reacciona a nada; los familiares empezaron a hacerle reanimacion en el carro.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-12", "score": 0.1197, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.1013, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.101, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.0944, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N5", "score": 0.0914, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.5415, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.907969+00:00", "case_id": "C002", "input_text": "Se cayo de una altura considerable, quedo inconsciente y no ha despertado desde entonces; tiene la piel muy palida.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "score": 0.0927, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.0645, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-12", "score": 0.058, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.0538, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-23", "score": 0.0519, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "confidence": 0.5898, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.908959+00:00", "case_id": "C003", "input_text": "Tiene una herida profunda en el brazo con un sangrado que no cede aunque le hacemos presion directa; ya se ve muy palido, mareado y casi no puede hablar.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.331, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-11", "score": 0.2889, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.1387, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.1268, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.1089, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.534, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.909899+00:00", "case_id": "C004", "input_text": "El bebe de 2 anos tiene fiebre de 40 grados, esta muy decaido, casi no reacciona y le noto el cuello muy rigido.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-4", "score": 0.2036, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-5", "score": 0.1589, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.1024, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.0897, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.0832, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-4", "confidence": 0.5617, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.909899+00:00", "case_id": "C005", "input_text": "Se esta ahogando con un pedazo de comida, no puede hablar ni toser, y se esta poniendo morado.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.0993, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.075, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.0662, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.0605, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-23", "score": 0.0496, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "RES5596-N2", "confidence": 0.5697, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.910899+00:00", "case_id": "C006", "input_text": "Tuvo un golpe fuerte en la cabeza jugando futbol, vomito varias veces seguidas y ahora tiene una pupila mas grande que la otra.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "score": 0.1386, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-12", "score": 0.1064, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-1", "score": 0.1028, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.0754, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.0705, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "confidence": 0.5741, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.911905+00:00", "case_id": "C007", "input_text": "Despues del choque el conductor esta muy palido, con el pulso muy rapido y debil, y no responde bien cuando le hablamos.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.1093, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-23", "score": 0.0699, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.0697, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-19", "score": 0.0689, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-8", "score": 0.0629, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "confidence": 0.6098, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.911905+00:00", "case_id": "C008", "input_text": "Desde hace media hora tengo un dolor en el pecho que se corre hacia el brazo izquierdo, estoy sudando frio y antes he tenido problemas del corazon.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.1356, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-0", "score": 0.0929, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.0637, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.0637, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-1", "score": 0.0588, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "confidence": 0.5935, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.912969+00:00", "case_id": "C009", "input_text": "Me falta el aire desde hace una hora, no puedo respirar bien, tengo los labios morados y siento que me ahogo.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.0743, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.069, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-20", "score": 0.0671, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-3", "score": 0.0567, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.0501, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.0, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_insuficiente", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.913900+00:00", "case_id": "C010", "input_text": "Empezo a convulsionar hace unos minutos, todavia le dieron temblores fuertes en todo el cuerpo y no responde con claridad despues.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.1056, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.0843, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.0819, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.0685, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.0658, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "confidence": 0.5561, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.913900+00:00", "case_id": "C011", "input_text": "Me siento muy mal y ya tengo un plan para quitarme la vida, incluso ya tengo listo lo que voy a usar.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.1949, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "score": 0.1174, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-8", "score": 0.109, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-12", "score": 0.0648, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-1", "score": 0.0634, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 3, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "confidence": 0.6242, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.914898+00:00", "case_id": "C012", "input_text": "Tiene una cortada en la pierna que sangra mucho y no para de sangrar desde hace veinte minutos, aunque todavia responde y habla bien.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.1087, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.0879, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.087, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-23", "score": 0.0858, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "score": 0.0856, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.5529, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.915933+00:00", "case_id": "C013", "input_text": "Empezaron a hablarme raro y de pronto no reconocia a su familia, se le torcio la boca de un lado hace menos de una hora.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.1882, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.1444, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.1276, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-12", "score": 0.1201, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "score": 0.1166, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "RES5596-N2", "confidence": 0.5658, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.915933+00:00", "case_id": "C014", "input_text": "Se desmayo de repente en la calle, cuando desperto estaba muy confundido y no sabia donde estaba.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "score": 0.095, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-12", "score": 0.0813, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.0757, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.0552, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.0551, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "confidence": 0.5567, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.917666+00:00", "case_id": "C015", "input_text": "Tengo un dolor en el pecho como una punzada que aumenta cuando respiro hondo, pero no me duele el brazo ni he sudado frio.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.1467, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-1", "score": 0.1459, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-0", "score": 0.1005, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.0882, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.0742, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.5012, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.918672+00:00", "case_id": "C016", "input_text": "Llevo mas de un dia con fiebre muy alta que no baja con nada, me duele todo el cuerpo pero estoy consciente y hablando normal.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.1569, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.1359, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.1348, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-4", "score": 0.1319, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.1121, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.5359, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.918672+00:00", "case_id": "C017", "input_text": "Ha tenido vomito y diarrea desde ayer, se ve con la boca seca y un poco decaido, pero todavia responde bien y camina.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-23", "score": 0.1085, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.1082, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-19", "score": 0.1069, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-8", "score": 0.0977, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.0875, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.5038, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.920185+00:00", "case_id": "C018", "input_text": "Se torcio el tobillo jugando y ahora esta muy hinchado y no puede apoyar el pie, cree que puede estar roto.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-15", "score": 0.101, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-24", "score": 0.0957, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-10", "score": 0.0709, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-23", "score": 0.0704, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-19", "score": 0.0694, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.5134, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T22:13:42.920185+00:00", "case_id": "C019", "input_text": "Tiene un dolor fuerte en la barriga desde hace varias horas, se queja mucho pero no tiene la barriga dura ni rechaza que se la toquen.", "corpus_format": "raw", "embedding_mode": "generic", "backend": "deterministic", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-16", "score": 0.1705, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-1", "score": 0.1683, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-RAW-12", "score": 0.158, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.074, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.0727, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "raw"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.5033, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "evidencia_contradictoria", "human_decision": null}
